# Web TypeScript state

Most Redux slices are persisted domain state. geminiApi and workerMetrics are left out of that snapshot. Some UI fields are stored in the same snapshot and hydrated back into Zustand. useIotStore keeps its own persisted settings. Do not treat every slice or every Zustand store as the same kind of storage. Cross the two stores through services/uiStateBridge.ts.

Render AI output with components/common/AiDisclaimer.tsx. Health and diagnosis surfaces pass medical. Call cloud AI through services/aiFacade.ts. User-visible strings go through t() or getT().
